---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms of Service | Studyinfo"
  description="Read our Terms of Service to understand the rules and regulations for using Studyinfo."
>
  <div class="legal-page">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p>Last updated: January 2025</p>
      <p>Please read these Terms of Service carefully before using the Studyinfo website.</p>

      <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>By accessing or using our service, you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you disagree with any part of the terms then you may not access the service.</p>

      <h2>2. Content</h2>
      <p>Our content is for informational purposes only. While we strive for accuracy, we make no warranties about the completeness, reliability, or accuracy of this information.</p>

      <h2>3. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>The service and its original content, features, and functionality are and will remain the exclusive property of Studyinfo and its licensors.</p>

      <h2>4. Links to Other Web Sites</h2>
      <p>Our service may contain links to third-party web sites or services that are not owned or controlled by Studyinfo.</p>

      <h2>5. Changes</h2>
      <p>We reserve the right, at our sole discretion, to modify or replace these Terms at any time.</p>

      <h2>6. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about these Terms, please contact us at help@studyinfo.net.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 4rem 0;
    background-color: var(--canvas-black);
    color: var(--muted-text);
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .container {
    max-width: 56rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1rem;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: 1.07px;
    color: var(--hazard-white);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: var(--hazard-white);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
</style>
